WEBVTT

00:10:26.077 --> 00:10:31.330
But suffering will eventually
and inevitably force change.

00:10:31.354 --> 00:10:35.719
But let's instead use
our neocortex, our new brain,

00:10:35.743 --> 00:10:38.822
to save the Elders, some of the oldest
creatures on the earth.

00:10:38.846 --> 00:10:42.799
And let's apply science
to harness the energy

00:10:42.823 --> 00:10:46.352
that has fueled the Elders
for millions of years --

00:10:47.649 --> 00:10:49.032
the sun.

00:10:49.056 --> 00:10:50.214
Thank you.

00:10:50.238 --> 00:10:53.087
(Applause)